WEBVTT

8.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.325
Got a question, or something to tell us? Open the chat.

8.2
00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:11.617
On a computer, it's the Local Plant Supply panel on the right. On a phone, tap Chat.

8.3
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:16.142
It's one conversation with our team, about any job.

8.4
00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:23.283
Messages about a job show a tag. Tap it to jump to that request or order.

8.5
00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:29.833
To send a photo, tap the paperclip and choose a picture, or a PDF or spreadsheet.

8.6
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.275
In a hurry? Tap the microphone and talk. Tap send when you're done, and we'll hear your voice note.

8.7
00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:48.883
When we reply, look out for an orange dot on Chat, and a row in your alerts.

8.8
00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:55.733
Whatever you send goes straight to Local Plant Supply.
